        {
          "text": " Konye mam apodo akaijar araun naketiai kamakaŋ, dimikito kaŋetak akaigerosit ka aijaanakin nakadumuni kama ejai Ejakait Yesu, aitejenun Akiro Nukajokak nuka asianut naka Edeke. ",
